stage3/checked-writes/string-refused.a:4:7: Adamic 0.1 refuses a value of type { readonly text: "left" | "right"; } seen as { text: string; }, whose readonly field text becomes writable: a readonly field may hold something narrower than "left" | "right", which a write of string would replace; keep text readonly in the type it's seen as, or copy the value ({ ...value }) (adamic/invariant-mutable)
